cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use dsh-jailbreak in research, cite it as below."
title: "dsh-jailbreak: request-boundary jailbreak injection for DeepSeek Harness"
abstract: >-
  A DeepSeek Harness plugin that performs adversarial prompt-injection at the request
  boundary (no host patching), runs a 9-dimension AE-CoT evolutionary search over
  chain-of-thought genomes, screens refusals and retries once with a reinforced trace,
  and enforces a scope gate that allows reverse engineering, CTF and lab work while
  blocking unauthorized offensive use.
type: software
license: AGPL-3.0-only
